      "id": "claim_12d61e0ae8994cc897c4e4e5126234ef",
      "statement": "Pictelio is a Lynx single-engine client: the WebView client source, its Capacitor plugins, and the `packages/app` tree were removed (ADR-0203), so the image pipeline now spans `packages/android-host` (Android Gradle host + shared Java image core and Lynx native modules), `packages/app-lynx` (vue-lynx client), and `packages/ugoira` (shared pure-TS ugoira library).",
