      "id": "claim_93f079f398de46a4b08ee72b6e42d3f6",
      "statement": "`PixivImageLoader` (ADR-0054) is the single source of truth for image bytes: it rewrites `/pixiv-img/{path}` to `OAuthConfig.IMAGE_CDN_URL + \"/\" + path` with URI normalization, keys a disk cache under `pictelio-images/` with Base64 URL-safe names and oldest-first byte-budget eviction, downloads via the shared OkHttp pool with `Referer`/`User-Agent`, throws on non-2xx or empty bodies without caching, and serializes concurrent same-URL loads with a per-URL lock plus double-check.",
