      "id": "claim_ed3ae05cab5b4d68b525ef5dcf1731b9",
      "statement": "The app-lynx display task is built from pure, node-tested functions: `proxyImageUrl`/`thumbUrl` rewrite the CDN URL to `/pixiv-img/...` and return an empty string for any absolute host outside `pximg.net`/`pixiv.net` (hostname via `safeParseUrl`, the `URL` global being banned per ADR-0172); `resolveQualityUrl` applies the `medium`/`large`/`original` fallback chains and `resolvePageSrcs` applies it per page so the result always has one element per page (empty string = explicit failure, not a dropped page), driven by `settings.detailQuality` (default `medium`); and `detailImageHeightVw`/`pageHeightVw` compute explicit `vw` container heights because native LynxView cannot animate `aspect-ratio` inside a `scroll-view` (ADR-0055).",
