      "statement": "The two image cache tiers are addressed in different key domains: the decoded-bitmap memory cache is keyed by the request URL passed to `fetchImage` (normally the `/pixiv-img/` path), while the disk cache is keyed by `keyToFilename(rewriteUrl(request))`, i.e. the official CDN URL; the URL returned by `ImageHostConfig.resolve` is never used as a key in either tier.",
